== Trivia ==
* This item's effect, if the coin flip succeeds, is almost identical to {{i|Diplopia}}'s.
** {{i|Diplopia}} can be copied by this item.
* Before [[Booster Pack #1]], it could be used on empty item pedestals to cause another item to appear.
* This item was [https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/4dhwsv/comment/d1r8u98/ originally suggested] by Reddit User /u/CultOfTheHelixFossil in a fan item suggestion thread made by Edmund McMillen.
* [https://www.reddit.com/r/bindingofisaac/comments/3ics6j/comment/cufj35j/?utm_source=share&utm_medium=web2x&context=3 According to the original post], the name "crooked" refers to that the item "can't be fully trusted" and is meant to differentiate it from other coin items.
* This item was inspired in part by the playstyle of YouTuber Northernlion, and his tendency toward Risk vs Reward items. (citation needed)

